+# service
+
+A small job service that writes its own log file.
+
+## Log rotation
+
+- The log rotates when it reaches `max_log_bytes` (default 10 MiB).
+- The old log goes to `<log>.1.gz`. The older archives move up to `.2.gz` and so on.
+- The service keeps 5 archives. The oldest one is deleted.
+- When the new log cannot be opened, the service keeps the old log and tries again at the next check.
